

<script
  src="{{ 'results-list.js' | asset_url }}"
  type="module"
  fetchpriority="low"
></script>

{% javascript %}
  const url = new URL(window.location.href);
  if (url.hash) {
    document.addEventListener(
      'DOMContentLoaded',
      () => {
        const card = document.getElementById(url.hash.slice(1));
        if (card) {
          card.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'instant' });
        }
      },
      { once: true }
    );
  }
{% endjavascript %}

{% comment %} We always render this full-width, as the child blocks have width: page/full settings {% endcomment %}
<div class="section-background color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}"></div>
<results-list
  class="section product-grid-container color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}"
  style="--padding-block-start: {{ section.settings.padding-block-start }}px; --padding-block-end: {{ section.settings.padding-block-end }}px;"
  section-id="{{ section.id }}"
  infinite-scroll="{{ section.settings.enable_infinite_scroll }}"
>
  {% render 'skip-to-content-link', href: '#ResultsList', text: 'accessibility.skip_to_results_list' %}

  <div
    class="collection-wrapper grid gap-style{% if section.settings.product_grid_width == 'full-width' %} collection-wrapper--grid-full-width{% endif %}"
  >
    {% content_for 'block',
      type: 'filters',
      id: 'filters',
      results: collection,
      results_size: collection.products_count
    %}

    {% assign products_per_page = 24 %}

    {% if section.settings.enable_infinite_scroll == false %}
      {% assign products_per_page = section.settings.products_per_page %}
    {% endif %}

    {% paginate collection.products by products_per_page %}
      {% capture children %}
        {%- comment -%}
          Eagle & Ash, 1 Nov 2026 (Anu: guide the buyer, like LOOV's collection pages): on gift collections, an intro
          above the products (collection field custom.intro) and one sentence under each product (collection field
          custom.gift_notes, JSON: product handle -> sentence). Empty fields = nothing extra (the Shop page).
          2 Nov 2026 (Anu: "LOVE the idea"): under the sentence, one true golf-history fact to tell when the gift is
          unwrapped (collection field custom.unwrap_facts, JSON: product handle -> fact).
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign ea_gift_notes = collection.metafields.custom.gift_notes.value -%}
        {%- assign ea_unwrap_facts = collection.metafields.custom.unwrap_facts.value -%}
        {%- assign ea_unwrap_sources = collection.metafields.custom.unwrap_sources.value -%}
        {%- if paginate.current_page == 1 and collection.metafields.custom.intro != blank -%}
          <li class="ea-gift-intro">
            <p>{{ collection.metafields.custom.intro.value | escape | newline_to_br }}</p>
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
        {% for product in collection.products %}
          <li
            id="{{ section.id }}-{{ product.id }}"
            class="product-grid__item product-grid__item--{{ forloop.index0 }}"
            data-page="{{ paginate.current_page }}"
            data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
            ref="cards[]"
          >
            {% # theme-check-disable %}
            {% content_for 'block', type: '_product-card', id: 'product-card', closest.product: product %}
            {% # theme-check-enable %}
            {%- assign ea_gift_note = ea_gift_notes[product.handle] -%}
            {%- assign ea_unwrap_fact = ea_unwrap_facts[product.handle] -%}
            {%- if ea_gift_note != blank or ea_unwrap_fact != blank -%}
              <div class="ea-collection-note">
                {%- if ea_gift_note != blank -%}
                  <span class="ea-collection-note__icon" aria-hidden="true" style="--ea-icon: url('{{ 'icon-gift-box.png' | file_url }}')"></span>
                  <p class="ea-collection-note__text">{{ ea_gift_note | escape }}</p>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- comment -%} 3 Nov 2026 (Anu: less text on phones): a <details>, closed on phones (tap to read),
                  always open on computers (CSS below); the text is in the page either way, so search engines read it. {%- endcomment -%}
                {%- if ea_unwrap_fact != blank -%}
                  <details class="ea-collection-fact">
                    <summary class="ea-collection-fact__label">A little story to go with it</summary>
                    <p class="ea-collection-fact__text">{{ ea_unwrap_fact | escape }}</p>
                    {%- comment -%} 3 Nov 2026 (Anu: sources must be visible): the source of the fact, from the collection
                      field custom.unwrap_sources (JSON: product handle -> [source name, URL]); none for a joke. {%- endcomment -%}
                    {%- assign ea_src = ea_unwrap_sources[product.handle] -%}
                    {%- if ea_src != blank -%}
                      <p class="ea-collection-fact__source">Source: <a href="{{ ea_src[1] | escape }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ ea_src[0] | escape }}<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </details>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
        {%- comment -%}
          Eagle & Ash, first page only: one review tile (28 Oct 2026), then the coming-soon gifts from the theme settings
          (29 Oct 2026). The review tile comes after the products; on computers it is drawn in the right-hand column
          over the first two rows (snippets/ea-review-tile), on phones it is the tile after the last product.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if paginate.current_page == 1 -%}
          {%- if section.settings.review_tile != blank -%}
            {%- render 'ea-review-tile',
              handle: section.settings.review_tile,
              image: section.settings.review_tile_image,
              link_label: section.settings.review_tile_link_label,
              link_url: section.settings.review_tile_link
            -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.show_soon -%}
            {%- render 'ea-soon-items', collection: collection, heading: section.settings.soon_heading -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {% endcapture %}

      {% render 'product-grid',
        section: section,
        children: children,
        products: collection.products,
        paginate: paginate,
        enable_infinite_scroll: section.settings.enable_infinite_scroll
      %}
    {% endpaginate %}
  </div>
</results-list>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* Eagle & Ash, 29 Oct 2026: prices as on the homepage cards, larger and bold (Anu: "please match them") */
  .product-grid product-price .price {
    font-family: var(--font-body--family);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* four products in a row at most (Anu, 29 Oct 2026; Horizon fits as many as the card size allows) */
  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .product-grid.product-grid--grid:not([product-grid-view='zoom-out']) {
      --product-grid-columns-desktop: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  /* gift collections: intro above the products and one guiding sentence under each card (1 Nov 2026) */
  .ea-gift-intro {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    list-style: none;
    margin-block-end: 8px;
  }

  .ea-gift-intro p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.55;

    @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }

  /* the card fills its grid cell by default (height: 100%); with a sentence under it, the cell grows instead */
  .product-grid__item:has(> .ea-collection-note) {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .product-grid__item:has(> .ea-collection-note) > .product-card {
    height: auto;
  }

  /* all sentences in a row start on the same line: each product takes two rows of the grid (card, sentence), and the
     card row is as tall as the tallest card in that row (Anu, 1 Nov 2026) */
  @supports (grid-template-rows: subgrid) {
    .product-grid__item:has(> .ea-collection-note) {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: subgrid;
      grid-row: span 2;
      row-gap: 10px;
    }

    .product-grid__item:has(> .ea-collection-note) > .ea-collection-note {
      margin-block-start: 0;
    }
  }

  /* a small gift icon in front of each sentence (Anu, 1 Nov 2026), in Blue Spectrum Dark like the FAQ label */
  .ea-collection-note {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  /* the same gift icon as in the trust strip ("Gift-ready"), in navy #001e26 like the product-page icons, 32 px box, as the strip icon (34 px; the file has empty space around the gift; Anu: more attention) */
  .ea-collection-note__icon {
    flex: none;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    margin-block: -6px -4px;
    margin-inline-start: -4px;
    background-color: #001e26;
    -webkit-mask: var(--ea-icon) center / contain no-repeat;
    mask: var(--ea-icon) center / contain no-repeat;
  }

  .ea-collection-note {
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-content: flex-start;
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-foreground);

    @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }

  .ea-collection-note__text {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* the fact to tell when the gift is unwrapped (2 Nov 2026): a full-width block under the sentence, no icon; the
     label in the small-text orange #b83a00 (5.3:1 on the light grey), a brand-orange line on the left */
  .ea-collection-fact {
    flex-basis: 100%;
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    padding: 10px 12px 11px 14px;
    border-inline-start: 3px solid #fd5000;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    background: #f4f3f1;
    color: #001e26;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;

    @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
      padding: 8px 10px 9px 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  }

  .ea-collection-fact__label {
    display: block;
    color: #b83a00;
    font-weight: 600;
    list-style: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ea-collection-fact__label::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  /* phones: a small arrow shows that the line opens; it turns down when open */
  .ea-collection-fact__label::after {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    margin-inline-start: 8px;
    border-inline-end: 2px solid currentColor;
    border-block-end: 2px solid currentColor;
    transform: translateY(-2px) rotate(-45deg);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ea-collection-fact[open] > .ea-collection-fact__label::after {
    transform: translateY(-3px) rotate(45deg);
  }

  .ea-collection-fact__text {
    margin: 2px 0 0;
  }

  .ea-collection-fact__source {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #4f6166;

    a {
      color: #4f6166;
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
    }
  }

  /* computers: always open, nothing to click (only where the browser can show a closed <details>' content) */
  @supports selector(::details-content) {
    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      .ea-collection-fact::details-content {
        content-visibility: visible;
      }

      .ea-collection-fact__label {
        pointer-events: none;
        cursor: default;
      }

      .ea-collection-fact__label::after {
        display: none;
      }
    }
  }


  /* the coming-soon gifts start a new row, under their own heading */
  .ea-soon-heading {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin-block-start: 40px;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .ea-soon-heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 30px;
    line-height: 1.3;

    @media screen and (max-width: 990px) {
      font-size: 24px;
    }
  }

  .product-grid[product-grid-view='zoom-out'] .ea-soon-heading {
    display: none;
  }

  .main-collection-grid {
    grid-column: var(--grid-column--mobile);

    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      grid-column: var(--grid-column--desktop);
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:names.collection_container",
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["collection"]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "layout_type",
      "label": "t:settings.type",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "grid",
          "label": "t:options.grid"
        },
        {
          "value": "organic",
          "label": "t:options.editorial"
        }
      ],
      "default": "grid"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "product_card_size",
      "label": "t:settings.card_size",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "small",
          "label": "t:options.small"
        },
        {
          "value": "medium",
          "label": "t:options.medium"
        },
        {
          "value": "large",
          "label": "t:options.large"
        },
        {
          "value": "extra-large",
          "label": "t:options.extra_large"
        }
      ],
      "default": "medium",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.layout_type == 'grid' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "mobile_product_card_size",
      "label": "t:settings.mobile_card_size",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "small",
          "label": "t:options.small"
        },
        {
          "value": "large",
          "label": "t:options.large"
        }
      ],
      "default": "small"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "enable_infinite_scroll",
      "label": "t:settings.auto_load_products",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "products_per_page",
      "label": "t:settings.products_per_page",
      "min": 8,
      "max": 36,
      "step": 4,
      "default": 24,
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.enable_infinite_scroll == false }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "product_grid_width",
      "label": "t:settings.width",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "centered",
          "label": "t:options.page"
        },
        {
          "value": "full-width",
          "label": "t:options.full"
        }
      ],
      "default": "centered"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "full_width_on_mobile",
      "label": "t:settings.full_width_on_mobile",
      "default": true,
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.product_grid_width != 'full-width' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "columns_gap_horizontal",
      "label": "t:settings.horizontal_gap",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "columns_gap_vertical",
      "label": "t:settings.vertical_gap",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-inline-start",
      "label": "t:settings.left_padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-inline-end",
      "label": "t:settings.right_padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.section_layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "t:settings.color_scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "t:settings.top_padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "t:settings.bottom_padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Review tile (Eagle & Ash)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "review_tile",
      "label": "Review",
      "info": "Handle of a testimonial entry (Content > Metaobjects > ea_testimonial), e.g. zip-quote-3. Empty: no tile."
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "review_tile_image",
      "label": "Photo behind the review"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "review_tile_link_label",
      "label": "Link under the review"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "review_tile_link",
      "label": "Link address"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "soon_heading",
      "label": "Heading above the coming-soon gifts",
      "default": "Coming soon"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_soon",
      "label": "Show the coming-soon gifts after the products",
      "info": "The gifts are set in Theme settings > Eagle & Ash: coming soon.",
      "default": false
    }
  ],
  "presets": []
}
{% endschema %}
